{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b850b711b450426c2e1145308b4f9e21ea6fd1119077dab69281bb693a45b038","ja":"注目の的","zh":"引人注目","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e1f6a4af26b6c5e28e88cea6d8a8ba49d466a41ed2bf6ce4c2d4cb1c7ef96baa","ja":"「……ええ。普段は舞台で歌っております。\nよろしければ今度、劇場にいらしてください」","zh":"“……是的。我平时都在舞台上唱歌。\n可以的话，下次请来剧场看看吧”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b6fe1b5cae6305bbd3e74a051b7f5ee41ac94520646180d26e5119c8c5a10ad5","ja":"「とっても素敵なお嬢さん、ですか？\nふふ、ありがとうございます」","zh":"“非常出色的小姐，是吗？\n呵呵，谢谢您”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"2bee45a9cdfdb0a5fe6830004b47b3b5dae9362d54828770b403beb728a9e68e","ja":"「マダムがよく聴かれる音楽、私も興味があります。\n勉強させていただきたいですわ」","zh":"“夫人经常听的音乐，我也很有兴趣。\n希望能向您学习呢”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"db39457e4a792343f699c2c59c54342d312c2c7134bf7afed8157996768dfe4e","ja":"「あら？　そちらの料理がおすすめなのですね。\nでは後程、私もいただきます」","zh":"「哎呀？那道料理是推荐菜品呢。\n那稍后我也尝尝看」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2","ja":"1時間後……","zh":"一个小时后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"bb85e87a4bd685c049fcc7c80f154c414e764ede18183e267307d0389b5c1a46","ja":"あっという間に時間が経っちゃった……。\nいろんな人に話しかけてもらったね。","zh":"时间转眼就过去了呢……\n好多人都来跟我们搭话了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"4741a9babb0d1ab45cd739e289a0e252e3a80ea09578f75fbd4040d81ec54e97","ja":"はい、堂々とするだけで本当に全然違いました。\nそれにしても真さん、どこに行っても大人気でしたね。","zh":"是的，只要表现得落落大方，效果就真的完全不一样。\n话虽如此，真小姐无论走到哪里都大受欢迎呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"ba8ed056d265e1b2301e6d6c7c106208365a40e02b1217a8ee68c11cff3beeff","ja":"へへっ、静香もね♪\n可奈たちはどう？　楽しめてる？","zh":"嘿嘿，静香也是呢♪\n可奈你们怎么样？玩得开心吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"2e44653750dc57e52147e04a8f75a2bc23ee6cf4efd77dffcd6a7c7bb4c3b6d2","ja":"えへへっ♪　かわいいって言われちゃいました♪\n私たち、大注目かも～♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪ 被人夸可爱了呢♪\n我们说不定超受关注的哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"864487b058a772f71b9885d77d3fb8027ebaac1932ff95f2c09cca5e65133f23","ja":"ありさはまさかの、うるわしのマダムたちと、\nアイドルちゃん談義ができちゃいました！","zh":"亚利沙竟然能和端庄优雅的贵妇人们，\n聊起偶像相关的话题了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"220a1687d24c02ea8719fe32c726975b8cf35e3271341ea052642cc3254cc84f","ja":"にひひっ、伊織ちゃんの言うとおりだったでしょ♪","zh":"嘻嘻，伊织说得没错吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"86efbaa67ea0719424b3e5f0d8ab10fc7aa5f5319d7940a2e409843d4cc42250","ja":"でもここからが勝負よ。このままパーティーを楽しんで\n参加してる人みんな、私たちのファンにしましょう。","zh":"不过接下来才是见真章的时候。就这样好好享受派对，\n让在场的所有参加者，全都成为我们的粉丝吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1370.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"ba6a02f6d99290224c46ca08b0965b4296566b82d01efa8e28bb66a8174153bc","ja":"だって私たちはアイドルなんだから♪","zh":"因为我们可是偶像呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
